{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001","id":"msg_01Tn645vvd9FFKkBou9aC6hs","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01C9CenRtuVREYYxrCh9hM9j","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cat > /tmp/exploration_summary.txt << 'EOF'\n# TANK-SIMULATION PROJECT EXPLORATION REPORT\n\n## PROJECT STRUCTURE\n\nThe project is a Rust-based freshwater aquarium/planted tank ecosystem simulator built as a monorepo with 4 crates:\n\n**Location**: /root/tank-simulation/\n**Main crates**:\n- tank_core: Core simulation engine (deterministic, state-based)\n- tank_data: Preset data loaders (source water, substrates, plants, shrimp, scenarios, process params)\n- tank_scenarios: Scenario materialization (converts presets to full TankState)\n- tank_tui: Terminal UI foundations (early stage, basic structure)\n\n**Key files**:\n- spec.md: Complete specification with milestones and requirements\n- Cargo.lock, Cargo.toml: Workspace manifest\n\n---\n\n## 1. WORKSPACE FILES & STRUCTURE\n\n**tank_core/src/**:\n- lib.rs: Public exports\n- engine.rs: Main Engine, SimulationEngine trait, step_one_hour, process_action, push_event\n- invariants.rs: Constraint enforcement on state (non-negative checks, clamping)\n- rng.rs: Deterministic ChaCha8 RNG with seed tracking\n- save.rs: SaveFile (schema v2, JSON serialization/deserialization)\n- types/mod.rs: Module exports\n- types/state.rs: TankState (main state struct)\n- types/water.rs: WaterState (15 dissolved totals stored as mg_total, not mg/l)\n- types/biology.rs: AlgaeState, MicrobeState, MicrofaunaState, AnimalState, DetritusState, PlantGuildState\n- types/events.rs: EventSeverity, EventKind, EventCause, SimEvent\n- types/geometry.rs: TankGeometry (dimensions, volume derivation)\n- types/hardware.rs: LightState, HeaterState, FilterHardware, AerationState, FilterState, HardwareState\n- types/substrate.rs: SubstrateKind enum, SubstrateLayerState\n- types/source_water.rs: SourceWaterProfile (15 chemistry fields per-liter)\n- types/actions.rs: PlayerAction enum, SimError enum, validation functions\n- types/environment.rs: EnvironmentState (ambient_temp, hour_of_day, day)\n- types/process.rs: ProcessParams (mineralization_rate, nitrification_vmax, reaeration_kla, k_surface, k_wall)\n- types/snapshot.rs: TankSnapshot (derived display quantities, includes NH3 calculation)\n- systems/mod.rs: Systems module exports\n- systems/temperature.rs: do_sat_mg_l, step_temperature (heater model)\n- systems/water_change.rs: validate_water_changes, apply_water_change\n\n**tank_core/tests/**:\n- ambient_temperature_action.rs: Tests temperature dynamics, DO saturation\n- water_change_mass_balance.rs: Tests water change mixing, catalog validation\n- tank_size_thermal_response.rs: Tests thermal response varies by volume\n- save_load.rs: Tests JSON serialization roundtrip, determinism\n- validation.rs: Tests action validation\n- determinism.rs: (likely minimal content)\n\n**tank_data/src/**:\n- lib.rs: load_source_water, load_substrate, load_plant, load_shrimp, load_process_params, load_scenario\n- presets.rs: Preset structs (SourceWaterPreset, SubstratePreset, PlantPreset, ShrimpPreset, ProcessParamsPreset, ScenarioPreset)\n- data/: TOML files for all presets\n\n**tank_scenarios/src/**:\n- lib.rs: seeded_state(seed, scenario_id) materializes scenario into full TankState\n\n**tank_tui/src/**:\n- lib.rs: TuiApp, Screen enum, basic structure\n\n---\n\n## 2. TYPES & STRUCTS DEFINED IN TANK_CORE\n\n### TankState (main state struct)\n```rust\npub struct TankState {\n    pub meta: SimMeta,\n    pub geometry: TankGeometry,\n    pub environment: EnvironmentState,\n    pub hardware: HardwareState,\n    pub water: WaterState,\n    pub substrate_layers: Vec<SubstrateLayerState>,\n    pub filter_state: FilterState,\n    pub plant_guilds: Vec<PlantGuildState>,\n    pub algae: AlgaeState,\n    pub microbe: MicrobeState,\n    pub microfauna: MicrofaunaState,\n    pub animal: AnimalState,\n    pub detritus: DetritusState,\n    pub event_log: Vec<SimEvent>,\n    pub rng: SimRng,\n    pub source_water_catalog: BTreeMap<String, SourceWaterProfile>,\n    pub process_params: ProcessParams,\n}\n```\n\n### Dissolved Pools in WaterState\n```rust\npub struct WaterState {\n    pub temperature_c: f64,\n    pub ammonia_total_mg_n_total: f64,          // TAN (Total Ammonia Nitrogen)\n    pub nitrite_mg_n_total: f64,\n    pub nitrate_mg_n_total: f64,\n    pub phosphate_mg_p_total: f64,\n    pub dissolved_oxygen_mg_total: f64,\n    pub dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_c_total: f64,\n    pub dissolved_organic_carbon_mg_c_total: f64,\n    pub dissolved_organic_nitrogen_mg_n_total: f64,\n    pub alkalinity_meq_total: f64,\n    pub calcium_mg_total: f64,\n    pub magnesium_mg_total: f64,\n    pub sodium_mg_total: f64,\n    pub potassium_mg_total: f64,\n    pub bicarbonate_mg_total: f64,\n    pub chloride_mg_total: f64,\n    pub sulfate_mg_total: f64,\n}\n```\n\n**Key observation**: All water chemistry stored as absolute mass (mg_total, meq_total), not concentrations. Concentrations derived at snapshot time for display.\n\n### Event Framework\n```rust\npub enum EventSeverity { Info, Warning, Critical }\n\npub enum EventKind {\n    CycleProgressing, AmmoniaWarning, NitriteWarning, OxygenDip,\n    AlgaeRiskRising, AlgaeBloom, BiofilmMaturityIncrease, ShrimpBerried,\n    EggFailure, MoltStressWarning, FilterCleaningSetback,\n    SubstrateFoulingWarning, StabilityImproving,\n}\n\npub enum EventCause {\n    RoutineAction, Overfeeding, WaterChange, FilterMaintenance,\n    HighAmmonia, HighNitrite, LowOxygen, HighTemperature, LowMinerals,\n    BiofilterImmature, SurfaceExchangeRestricted,\n}\n\npub struct SimEvent {\n    pub day: u32,\n    pub hour: u8,\n    pub severity: EventSeverity,\n    pub kind: EventKind,\n    pub cause_codes: Vec<EventCause>,\n    pub summary: String,\n}\n```\n\n**Status**: Event framework FULLY DEFINED with enum types. Engine has push_event() method. No logic yet to emit events based on chemistry/biology.\n\n### Biology State Structs\n```rust\npub struct MicrobeState {\n    pub decomposer_biomass_g: f64,\n    pub ammonia_oxidizer_biomass_g: f64,      // AOA guild\n    pub nitrite_oxidizer_biomass_g: f64,      // NOB guild\n    pub comammox_biomass_g: f64,               // Comammox Nitrospira\n    pub maturity_index: f64,                   // 0.0-1.0\n}\n\npub struct AnimalState {\n    pub adults_count: u32,\n    pub juveniles_count: u32,\n    pub berried_females_count: u32,\n    pub condition_index: f64,\n    pub molt_stress_index: f64,\n    pub reproductive_readiness_index: f64,\n    pub egg_progress_days: f64,\n}\n\npub struct DetritusState {\n    pub particulate_organics_g_total: f64,\n    pub fine_detritus_g_total: f64,\n    pub dissolved_feed_residue_g_total: f64,\n}\n\npub struct AlgaeState {\n    pub suspended_biomass_g: f64,\n    pub periphyton_biomass_g: f64,\n    pub nuisance_index: f64,\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. SIMULATION SYSTEMS ALREADY IMPLEMENTED\n\n### TEMPERATURE SYSTEM (complete)\n- **File**: tank_core/src/systems/temperature.rs\n- do_sat_mg_l(temp_c): Interpolated DO saturation (0→14.6, 10→11.3, 20→9.1, 30→7.6 mg/L)\n- step_temperature(state): Hourly discrete model\n  - Heat capacity: 4186 J/(L·K)\n  - Surface exchange (top) with adjustable factor (1.0 if open, 0.25 if lidded)\n  - Wall exchange\n  - Heater: fires when temp < setpoint - deadband/2, output = max_watts * efficiency\n  - Ambient heat transfer based on U/A values (k_surface, k_wall)\n- Tests: 6 tests covering warmup, DO saturation, heater behavior\n- Status: ✓ FULLY IMPLEMENTED & TESTED\n\n### WATER CHANGE SYSTEM (complete)\n- **File**: tank_core/src/systems/water_change.rs\n- validate_water_changes(): Pre-validates all queued water changes against catalog\n- apply_water_change(percent, source): \n  - Removes percent/100 of each dissolved total\n  - Adds replacement from source profile (scaled by exchanged liters)\n  - Mixes temperature proportionally\n- Tests: 6 tests covering mass balance, temperature mixing, catalog validation\n- Status: ✓ FULLY IMPLEMENTED & TESTED\n\n### HARDWARE MODEL (partial)\n- **File**: tank_core/src/types/hardware.rs, engine.rs\n- Heater: setpoint, deadband, max_watts, efficiency, last_output_w\n- Filter: enabled, flow_lph, cleanliness_index\n- Light: enabled, photoperiod_hours, intensity_index\n- Aeration: enabled, intensity\n- PlayerAction support for all hardware changes\n- Status: ✓ STATE & ACTION FRAMEWORK EXISTS, NO SYSTEMS YET\n\n### GEOMETRY MODEL (complete)\n- **File**: tank_core/src/types/geometry.rs\n- Tank volume derivation, surface area, wall area, footprint\n- Surface/volume and wall/volume ratios\n- Top exchange factor (open vs lidded)\n- Status: ✓ FULLY IMPLEMENTED\n\n---\n\n## 4. WHAT'S MISSING FOR MILESTONE 3\n\n### Dissolved Pool Tracking - CURRENT STATE\n- ✓ All 15 dissolved pools defined in WaterState\n- ✓ Water initialization from source profiles (geometry × per-liter values)\n- ✓ Water change mixing (removes + adds)\n- ✓ Mass balance preservation\n- ✗ **MISSING**: Systems that consume/produce these pools (decomposition, nitrification, aeration, plant uptake, etc.)\n\n### NH3 Calculation - ALREADY IMPLEMENTED\n- **File**: tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs, lines 46-54\n- Calculates:\n  - pH from alkalinity, DIC, temperature using Henderson-Hasselbalch\n  - pKa from temperature: 0.09018 + 2729.92/(273.2 + temp_c)\n  - NH3 fraction: 1 / (1 + 10^(pKa - pH))\n  - nh3_mg_l = tan_mg_l × fraction_nh3\n- Status: ✓ **FULLY IMPLEMENTED IN SNAPSHOT** (but not used in simulation yet)\n\n### DO Model - PARTIALLY IMPLEMENTED\n- ✓ do_sat_mg_l() function exists and tested\n- ✓ DO stored in WaterState\n- ✓ DO saturation shown in snapshot\n- ✗ **MISSING**: \n  - Reaeration system (uptake from air based on reaeration_kla)\n  - Respiration consumption (from microbes, animals, plants)\n  - Detritus oxidation\n\n### Event Framework - FULLY DEFINED, ZERO LOGIC\n- ✓ EventSeverity, EventKind, EventCause enums defined\n- ✓ Engine has push_event() method\n- ✓ event_log stored in TankState\n- ✓ Events exposed in TankSnapshot (last 20)\n- ✗ **MISSING**: \n  - Event emission logic (no system checks chemistry/biology to decide events)\n  - AmmoniaWarning, NitriteWarning, OxygenDip events never triggered\n  - No thresholds defined\n\n### Nitrification - NOT YET IMPLEMENTED\n- ✓ MicrobeState has ammonia_oxidizer, nitrite_oxidizer, comammox biomass + maturity_index\n- ✗ **MISSING**:\n  - Growth/decay kinetics\n  - Nitrification rate calculation\n  - Ammonia → Nitrite → Nitrate transformations\n  - Temperature/pH modulation\n  - Oxygen dependency\n\n### Decomposition - NOT YET IMPLEMENTED\n- ✓ DetritusState has 3 pools (particulate, fine, dissolved)\n- ✗ **MISSING**:\n  - Breakdown kinetics (particulate → fine → dissolved)\n  - Mineralization (organic N → ammonia)\n  - Decomposer guild dynamics\n  - ProcessParams has mineralization_rate_per_day but not used\n\n---\n\n## 5. TESTS & COVERAGE\n\n**Total test files**: 6 in tank_core/tests/\n\n1. **ambient_temperature_action.rs** (6 tests)\n   - Ambient temperature change causes gradual warming\n   - DO saturation decreases with warming\n   - Heater output zero above setpoint\n   - Heater never cools\n   - Heater fires below setpoint - deadband/2\n\n2. **water_change_mass_balance.rs** (7 tests)\n   - 50% water change halves dissolved totals\n   - 0% water change is no-op\n   - 100% yields source temperature\n   - 50% mixes temperature\n   - Unknown profile returns error\n   - Invalid profile leaves state unchanged\n   - Negative chemistry detected\n\n3. **tank_size_thermal_response.rs** (2 tests)\n   - Smaller tank responds faster to ambient change\n   - Lid slows surface heat exchange\n\n4. **save_load.rs** (3 tests)\n   - JSON roundtrip\n   - Source water catalog survives\n   - Determinism across save/load/resume\n\n5. **validation.rs** (2 tests)\n   - Action validation (fractions, percentages, temperatures)\n   - Action queuing\n\n6. **determinism.rs** (likely minimal)\n\n**Test coverage**: ✓ Temperature, ✓ Water change, ✓ Geometry, ✓ Save/load, ✓ Actions\n**NOT tested**: Nitrification, Decomposition, Events, Oxygen dynamics, Biology\n\n---\n\n## 6. PLAYER ACTIONS IMPLEMENTED\n\n**PlayerAction enum** (types/actions.rs):\n- Feed { grams }\n- WaterChangePercent { percent, source_profile_id }\n- TrimPlants { fraction }\n- SiphonDetritus { fraction }\n- CleanFilter { intensity }\n- AddShrimp { count }\n- RemoveShrimp { count }\n- ChangePhotoperiod { hours }\n- ChangeLightIntensity { intensity_index }\n- ChangeHeaterSetpoint { setpoint_c }\n- ChangeAmbientTemperature { target_c }\n- ChangeAeration { enabled, intensity }\n\nAll have validation in place. Engine processes queued actions in step_one_hour before stepping systems.\n\n---\n\n## 7. SIMULATION LOOP (engine.rs)\n\n**step_one_hour()**:\n1. Pre-validate all water changes in queue (catalog lookup)\n2. Process all queued actions (Feed, WaterChange, etc.)\n3. step_temperature()\n4. Advance time (hour_of_day += 1, day += 1 if hour wraps)\n5. enforce_invariants()\n\n**Current action processing** (process_action):\n- Feed: adds to detritus.particulate_organics_g_total, logs event\n- WaterChangePercent: calls apply_water_change, logs event\n- TrimPlants: reduces plant biomass\n- SiphonDetritus: reduces detritus\n- CleanFilter: resets cleanliness, reduces maturity\n- AddShrimp/RemoveShrimp: modifies animal counts\n- Light/Heater/Aeration changes: update hardware state\n\n**Missing from loop**: \n- Decomposition system\n- Nitrification system\n- Reaeration system\n- Plant growth system\n- Algae system\n- Microfauna system\n- Shrimp feeding/reproduction system\n- Event emission logic\n\n---\n\n## 8. INVARIANT ENFORCEMENT\n\n**File**: invariants.rs\n- Non-negative checks: ~20 fields (ammonia, nitrite, nitrate, phosphate, all detritus, all plant/microbe biomass, temperature, depth)\n- Clamping: 0-1 for index fields (light intensity, filter maturity, algae nuisance, etc.)\n- Temperature > 0 requirement\n- Event log truncation (keep last 200)\n- Runs after every step_one_hour()\n\n---\n\n## 9. DATA LAYER\n\n**tank_data/src/** supplies:\n- source_water_ids(): [soft_acidic, moderate, hard_shrimp, ro_like]\n- substrate_ids(): [inert_sand, inert_gravel, active_planted, coarse_porous]\n- plant_ids(): [fast_stem, root_rosette]\n- shrimp_ids(): [neocaridina_davidi]\n- process_ids(): [default]\n- scenario_ids(): [nano_cycle, medium_planted, warm_room]\n\n**tank_scenarios/** materializes scenario preset into full TankState:\n- Geometry from scenario\n- Water from source water profile\n- Substrate/plant/process from preset IDs\n- Source water catalog pre-populated with all known profiles\n\n---\n\n## 10. SNAPSHOT & UI EXPOSURE\n\n**TankSnapshot** (types/snapshot.rs) exposes per-liter values derived from totals:\n- day, hour\n- water_temp_c\n- water_volume_l\n- tan_mg_l (total ammonia nitrogen)\n- nh3_mg_l (unionized ammonia, calculated)\n- nitrite_mg_l, nitrate_mg_l, phosphate_mg_l\n- do_mg_l (dissolved oxygen)\n- do_sat_mg_l (saturation at current temp)\n- gh_d (General Hardness in degrees)\n- kh_d (Carbonate Hardness)\n- tds_mg_l (Total Dissolved Solids)\n- conductivity_us_cm\n- ph (calculated from alkalinity + DIC)\n- adult_shrimp_count\n- total_plant_biomass_g\n- last_heater_output_w\n- recent_events (last 20)\n\n**TuiApp** (tank_tui/src/) is a placeholder with:\n- Screen enum: Overview, Chemistry, Biology, Actions, Log\n- queue_action, update_snapshot methods\n- No rendering or event loop yet\n\n---\n\n## 11. CRITICAL IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS\n\n### Mass Balance Approach\n- All internal state is mass/amount (mg, meq, g, count)\n- Concentrations derived at display time (snapshot)\n- Water changes work on absolute masses, not concentrations\n- This ensures determinism and correctness\n\n### Determinism\n- ChaCha8Rng with seed tracking (draws count)\n- SimRng serializable for save/load\n- Same seed + actions + version = same state (proven by save_load_resume_determinism test)\n\n### Temperature Physics\n- Uses hourly discrete steps with dT = (Q/C_p) × dt\n- Surface exchange adjustable by geometry (open vs lidded)\n- Heat transfer coefficients (k_surface, k_wall) stored in ProcessParams\n\n### Event Framework Ready\n- 13 EventKind variants defined\n- 11 EventCause codes\n- 3 severity levels\n- Engine accepts events anytime via push_event()\n- Ready for chemistry-based thresholds\n\n---\n\n## 12. WHAT WORKS TODAY\n\n✓ Tank geometry modeling\n✓ Temperature dynamics (heater + ambient)\n✓ DO saturation calculation\n✓ pH and NH3 fraction calculation\n✓ Water change mixing (mass balance)\n✓ Source water profiling\n✓ Player action queueing & validation\n✓ Event framework (data structures + logging)\n✓ Deterministic save/load\n✓ Scenario materialization\n✓ RNG with deterministic continuation\n\n---\n\n## 13. WHAT'S NEEDED FOR MILESTONE 3\n\n1. **Decomposition System** (systems/decomposition.rs)\n   - Particulate → Fine → Dissolved breakdown\n   - Organic N mineralization to ammonia\n   - Use ProcessParams.mineralization_rate_per_day\n\n2. **Nitrification System** (systems/nitrification.rs)\n   - Ammonia oxidizer growth (AOA)\n   - Nitrite oxidizer growth (NOB)\n   - Comammox pathway\n   - TAN → NO2 → NO3 (3 stages)\n   - Temperature/pH/O2 dependencies\n   - Use ProcessParams.nitrification_vmax\n\n3. **Reaeration System** (systems/reaeration.rs)\n   - DO uptake from air\n   - Surface exchange based on reaeration_kla\n   - Aeration hardware boost (if enabled)\n   - Temperature effect on saturation\n\n4. **Event Emission Logic** (engine.rs or systems)\n   - Check for AmmoniaWarning (nh3_mg_l > threshold)\n   - Check for NitriteWarning (nitrite > threshold)\n   - Check for OxygenDip (do_mg_l < do_sat_mg_l × 0.5)\n   - Integrate into step_one_hour()\n\n5. **Chemistry Helper Functions**\n   - Ionization state calculations\n   - Toxicity indices\n   - Stress thresholds\n\n**Estimated files to create**:\n- systems/decomposition.rs\n- systems/nitrification.rs\n- systems/reaeration.rs\n- types/chemistry_helpers.rs (or inline in systems)\n- Additional tests for all 3 systems\n\n---\n\nEND OF REPORT\nEOF\ncat /tmp/exploration_summary.txt\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2188,"cache_read_input_tokens":64365,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":2188,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SdK2x77EeKtVykT9EyhLAo","session_id":"6255bc57-f0df-446f-b528-6846cbe58c9c","uuid":"4075c0e6-3be4-459c-aba7-d845aba9c0f8"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01C9CenRtuVREYYxrCh9hM9j","type":"tool_result","content":"# TANK-SIMULATION PROJECT EXPLORATION REPORT\n\n## PROJECT STRUCTURE\n\nThe project is a Rust-based freshwater aquarium/planted tank ecosystem simulator built as a monorepo with 4 crates:\n\n**Location**: /root/tank-simulation/\n**Main crates**:\n- tank_core: Core simulation engine (deterministic, state-based)\n- tank_data: Preset data loaders (source water, substrates, plants, shrimp, scenarios, process params)\n- tank_scenarios: Scenario materialization (converts presets to full TankState)\n- tank_tui: Terminal UI foundations (early stage, basic structure)\n\n**Key files**:\n- spec.md: Complete specification with milestones and requirements\n- Cargo.lock, Cargo.toml: Workspace manifest\n\n---\n\n## 1. WORKSPACE FILES & STRUCTURE\n\n**tank_core/src/**:\n- lib.rs: Public exports\n- engine.rs: Main Engine, SimulationEngine trait, step_one_hour, process_action, push_event\n- invariants.rs: Constraint enforcement on state (non-negative checks, clamping)\n- rng.rs: Deterministic ChaCha8 RNG with seed tracking\n- save.rs: SaveFile (schema v2, JSON serialization/deserialization)\n- types/mod.rs: Module exports\n- types/state.rs: TankState (main state struct)\n- types/water.rs: WaterState (15 dissolved totals stored as mg_total, not mg/l)\n- types/biology.rs: AlgaeState, MicrobeState, MicrofaunaState, AnimalState, DetritusState, PlantGuildState\n- types/events.rs: EventSeverity, EventKind, EventCause, SimEvent\n- types/geometry.rs: TankGeometry (dimensions, volume derivation)\n- types/hardware.rs: LightState, HeaterState, FilterHardware, AerationState, FilterState, HardwareState\n- types/substrate.rs: SubstrateKind enum, SubstrateLayerState\n- types/source_water.rs: SourceWaterProfile (15 chemistry fields per-liter)\n- types/actions.rs: PlayerAction enum, SimError enum, validation functions\n- types/environment.rs: EnvironmentState (ambient_temp, hour_of_day, day)\n- types/process.rs: ProcessParams (mineralization_rate, nitrification_vmax, reaeration_kla, k_surface, k_wall)\n- types/snapshot.rs: TankSnapshot (derived display quantities, includes NH3 calculation)\n- systems/mod.rs: Systems module exports\n- systems/temperature.rs: do_sat_mg_l, step_temperature (heater model)\n- systems/water_change.rs: validate_water_changes, apply_water_change\n\n**tank_core/tests/**:\n- ambient_temperature_action.rs: Tests temperature dynamics, DO saturation\n- water_change_mass_balance.rs: Tests water change mixing, catalog validation\n- tank_size_thermal_response.rs: Tests thermal response varies by volume\n- save_load.rs: Tests JSON serialization roundtrip, determinism\n- validation.rs: Tests action validation\n- determinism.rs: (likely minimal content)\n\n**tank_data/src/**:\n- lib.rs: load_source_water, load_substrate, load_plant, load_shrimp, load_process_params, load_scenario\n- presets.rs: Preset structs (SourceWaterPreset, SubstratePreset, PlantPreset, ShrimpPreset, ProcessParamsPreset, ScenarioPreset)\n- data/: TOML files for all presets\n\n**tank_scenarios/src/**:\n- lib.rs: seeded_state(seed, scenario_id) materializes scenario into full TankState\n\n**tank_tui/src/**:\n- lib.rs: TuiApp, Screen enum, basic structure\n\n---\n\n## 2. TYPES & STRUCTS DEFINED IN TANK_CORE\n\n### TankState (main state struct)\n```rust\npub struct TankState {\n    pub meta: SimMeta,\n    pub geometry: TankGeometry,\n    pub environment: EnvironmentState,\n    pub hardware: HardwareState,\n    pub water: WaterState,\n    pub substrate_layers: Vec<SubstrateLayerState>,\n    pub filter_state: FilterState,\n    pub plant_guilds: Vec<PlantGuildState>,\n    pub algae: AlgaeState,\n    pub microbe: MicrobeState,\n    pub microfauna: MicrofaunaState,\n    pub animal: AnimalState,\n    pub detritus: DetritusState,\n    pub event_log: Vec<SimEvent>,\n    pub rng: SimRng,\n    pub source_water_catalog: BTreeMap<String, SourceWaterProfile>,\n    pub process_params: ProcessParams,\n}\n```\n\n### Dissolved Pools in WaterState\n```rust\npub struct WaterState {\n    pub temperature_c: f64,\n    pub ammonia_total_mg_n_total: f64,          // TAN (Total Ammonia Nitrogen)\n    pub nitrite_mg_n_total: f64,\n    pub nitrate_mg_n_total: f64,\n    pub phosphate_mg_p_total: f64,\n    pub dissolved_oxygen_mg_total: f64,\n    pub dissolved_inorganic_carbon_mg_c_total: f64,\n    pub dissolved_organic_carbon_mg_c_total: f64,\n    pub dissolved_organic_nitrogen_mg_n_total: f64,\n    pub alkalinity_meq_total: f64,\n    pub calcium_mg_total: f64,\n    pub magnesium_mg_total: f64,\n    pub sodium_mg_total: f64,\n    pub potassium_mg_total: f64,\n    pub bicarbonate_mg_total: f64,\n    pub chloride_mg_total: f64,\n    pub sulfate_mg_total: f64,\n}\n```\n\n**Key observation**: All water chemistry stored as absolute mass (mg_total, meq_total), not concentrations. Concentrations derived at snapshot time for display.\n\n### Event Framework\n```rust\npub enum EventSeverity { Info, Warning, Critical }\n\npub enum EventKind {\n    CycleProgressing, AmmoniaWarning, NitriteWarning, OxygenDip,\n    AlgaeRiskRising, AlgaeBloom, BiofilmMaturityIncrease, ShrimpBerried,\n    EggFailure, MoltStressWarning, FilterCleaningSetback,\n    SubstrateFoulingWarning, StabilityImproving,\n}\n\npub enum EventCause {\n    RoutineAction, Overfeeding, WaterChange, FilterMaintenance,\n    HighAmmonia, HighNitrite, LowOxygen, HighTemperature, LowMinerals,\n    BiofilterImmature, SurfaceExchangeRestricted,\n}\n\npub struct SimEvent {\n    pub day: u32,\n    pub hour: u8,\n    pub severity: EventSeverity,\n    pub kind: EventKind,\n    pub cause_codes: Vec<EventCause>,\n    pub summary: String,\n}\n```\n\n**Status**: Event framework FULLY DEFINED with enum types. Engine has push_event() method. No logic yet to emit events based on chemistry/biology.\n\n### Biology State Structs\n```rust\npub struct MicrobeState {\n    pub decomposer_biomass_g: f64,\n    pub ammonia_oxidizer_biomass_g: f64,      // AOA guild\n    pub nitrite_oxidizer_biomass_g: f64,      // NOB guild\n    pub comammox_biomass_g: f64,               // Comammox Nitrospira\n    pub maturity_index: f64,                   // 0.0-1.0\n}\n\npub struct AnimalState {\n    pub adults_count: u32,\n    pub juveniles_count: u32,\n    pub berried_females_count: u32,\n    pub condition_index: f64,\n    pub molt_stress_index: f64,\n    pub reproductive_readiness_index: f64,\n    pub egg_progress_days: f64,\n}\n\npub struct DetritusState {\n    pub particulate_organics_g_total: f64,\n    pub fine_detritus_g_total: f64,\n    pub dissolved_feed_residue_g_total: f64,\n}\n\npub struct AlgaeState {\n    pub suspended_biomass_g: f64,\n    pub periphyton_biomass_g: f64,\n    pub nuisance_index: f64,\n}\n```\n\n---\n\n## 3. SIMULATION SYSTEMS ALREADY IMPLEMENTED\n\n### TEMPERATURE SYSTEM (complete)\n- **File**: tank_core/src/systems/temperature.rs\n- do_sat_mg_l(temp_c): Interpolated DO saturation (0→14.6, 10→11.3, 20→9.1, 30→7.6 mg/L)\n- step_temperature(state): Hourly discrete model\n  - Heat capacity: 4186 J/(L·K)\n  - Surface exchange (top) with adjustable factor (1.0 if open, 0.25 if lidded)\n  - Wall exchange\n  - Heater: fires when temp < setpoint - deadband/2, output = max_watts * efficiency\n  - Ambient heat transfer based on U/A values (k_surface, k_wall)\n- Tests: 6 tests covering warmup, DO saturation, heater behavior\n- Status: ✓ FULLY IMPLEMENTED & TESTED\n\n### WATER CHANGE SYSTEM (complete)\n- **File**: tank_core/src/systems/water_change.rs\n- validate_water_changes(): Pre-validates all queued water changes against catalog\n- apply_water_change(percent, source): \n  - Removes percent/100 of each dissolved total\n  - Adds replacement from source profile (scaled by exchanged liters)\n  - Mixes temperature proportionally\n- Tests: 6 tests covering mass balance, temperature mixing, catalog validation\n- Status: ✓ FULLY IMPLEMENTED & TESTED\n\n### HARDWARE MODEL (partial)\n- **File**: tank_core/src/types/hardware.rs, engine.rs\n- Heater: setpoint, deadband, max_watts, efficiency, last_output_w\n- Filter: enabled, flow_lph, cleanliness_index\n- Light: enabled, photoperiod_hours, intensity_index\n- Aeration: enabled, intensity\n- PlayerAction support for all hardware changes\n- Status: ✓ STATE & ACTION FRAMEWORK EXISTS, NO SYSTEMS YET\n\n### GEOMETRY MODEL (complete)\n- **File**: tank_core/src/types/geometry.rs\n- Tank volume derivation, surface area, wall area, footprint\n- Surface/volume and wall/volume ratios\n- Top exchange factor (open vs lidded)\n- Status: ✓ FULLY IMPLEMENTED\n\n---\n\n## 4. WHAT'S MISSING FOR MILESTONE 3\n\n### Dissolved Pool Tracking - CURRENT STATE\n- ✓ All 15 dissolved pools defined in WaterState\n- ✓ Water initialization from source profiles (geometry × per-liter values)\n- ✓ Water change mixing (removes + adds)\n- ✓ Mass balance preservation\n- ✗ **MISSING**: Systems that consume/produce these pools (decomposition, nitrification, aeration, plant uptake, etc.)\n\n### NH3 Calculation - ALREADY IMPLEMENTED\n- **File**: tank_core/src/types/snapshot.rs, lines 46-54\n- Calculates:\n  - pH from alkalinity, DIC, temperature using Henderson-Hasselbalch\n  - pKa from temperature: 0.09018 + 2729.92/(273.2 + temp_c)\n  - NH3 fraction: 1 / (1 + 10^(pKa - pH))\n  - nh3_mg_l = tan_mg_l × fraction_nh3\n- Status: ✓ **FULLY IMPLEMENTED IN SNAPSHOT** (but not used in simulation yet)\n\n### DO Model - PARTIALLY IMPLEMENTED\n- ✓ do_sat_mg_l() function exists and tested\n- ✓ DO stored in WaterState\n- ✓ DO saturation shown in snapshot\n- ✗ **MISSING**: \n  - Reaeration system (uptake from air based on reaeration_kla)\n  - Respiration consumption (from microbes, animals, plants)\n  - Detritus oxidation\n\n### Event Framework - FULLY DEFINED, ZERO LOGIC\n- ✓ EventSeverity, EventKind, EventCause enums defined\n- ✓ Engine has push_event() method\n- ✓ event_log stored in TankState\n- ✓ Events exposed in TankSnapshot (last 20)\n- ✗ **MISSING**: \n  - Event emission logic (no system checks chemistry/biology to decide events)\n  - AmmoniaWarning, NitriteWarning, OxygenDip events never triggered\n  - No thresholds defined\n\n### Nitrification - NOT YET IMPLEMENTED\n- ✓ MicrobeState has ammonia_oxidizer, nitrite_oxidizer, comammox biomass + maturity_index\n- ✗ **MISSING**:\n  - Growth/decay kinetics\n  - Nitrification rate calculation\n  - Ammonia → Nitrite → Nitrate transformations\n  - Temperature/pH modulation\n  - Oxygen dependency\n\n### Decomposition - NOT YET IMPLEMENTED\n- ✓ DetritusState has 3 pools (particulate, fine, dissolved)\n- ✗ **MISSING**:\n  - Breakdown kinetics (particulate → fine → dissolved)\n  - Mineralization (organic N → ammonia)\n  - Decomposer guild dynamics\n  - ProcessParams has mineralization_rate_per_day but not used\n\n---\n\n## 5. TESTS & COVERAGE\n\n**Total test files**: 6 in tank_core/tests/\n\n1. **ambient_temperature_action.rs** (6 tests)\n   - Ambient temperature change causes gradual warming\n   - DO saturation decreases with warming\n   - Heater output zero above setpoint\n   - Heater never cools\n   - Heater fires below setpoint - deadband/2\n\n2. **water_change_mass_balance.rs** (7 tests)\n   - 50% water change halves dissolved totals\n   - 0% water change is no-op\n   - 100% yields source temperature\n   - 50% mixes temperature\n   - Unknown profile returns error\n   - Invalid profile leaves state unchanged\n   - Negative chemistry detected\n\n3. **tank_size_thermal_response.rs** (2 tests)\n   - Smaller tank responds faster to ambient change\n   - Lid slows surface heat exchange\n\n4. **save_load.rs** (3 tests)\n   - JSON roundtrip\n   - Source water catalog survives\n   - Determinism across save/load/resume\n\n5. **validation.rs** (2 tests)\n   - Action validation (fractions, percentages, temperatures)\n   - Action queuing\n\n6. **determinism.rs** (likely minimal)\n\n**Test coverage**: ✓ Temperature, ✓ Water change, ✓ Geometry, ✓ Save/load, ✓ Actions\n**NOT tested**: Nitrification, Decomposition, Events, Oxygen dynamics, Biology\n\n---\n\n## 6. PLAYER ACTIONS IMPLEMENTED\n\n**PlayerAction enum** (types/actions.rs):\n- Feed { grams }\n- WaterChangePercent { percent, source_profile_id }\n- TrimPlants { fraction }\n- SiphonDetritus { fraction }\n- CleanFilter { intensity }\n- AddShrimp { count }\n- RemoveShrimp { count }\n- ChangePhotoperiod { hours }\n- ChangeLightIntensity { intensity_index }\n- ChangeHeaterSetpoint { setpoint_c }\n- ChangeAmbientTemperature { target_c }\n- ChangeAeration { enabled, intensity }\n\nAll have validation in place. Engine processes queued actions in step_one_hour before stepping systems.\n\n---\n\n## 7. SIMULATION LOOP (engine.rs)\n\n**step_one_hour()**:\n1. Pre-validate all water changes in queue (catalog lookup)\n2. Process all queued actions (Feed, WaterChange, etc.)\n3. step_temperature()\n4. Advance time (hour_of_day += 1, day += 1 if hour wraps)\n5. enforce_invariants()\n\n**Current action processing** (process_action):\n- Feed: adds to detritus.particulate_organics_g_total, logs event\n- WaterChangePercent: calls apply_water_change, logs event\n- TrimPlants: reduces plant biomass\n- SiphonDetritus: reduces detritus\n- CleanFilter: resets cleanliness, reduces maturity\n- AddShrimp/RemoveShrimp: modifies animal counts\n- Light/Heater/Aeration changes: update hardware state\n\n**Missing from loop**: \n- Decomposition system\n- Nitrification system\n- Reaeration system\n- Plant growth system\n- Algae system\n- Microfauna system\n- Shrimp feeding/reproduction system\n- Event emission logic\n\n---\n\n## 8. INVARIANT ENFORCEMENT\n\n**File**: invariants.rs\n- Non-negative checks: ~20 fields (ammonia, nitrite, nitrate, phosphate, all detritus, all plant/microbe biomass, temperature, depth)\n- Clamping: 0-1 for index fields (light intensity, filter maturity, algae nuisance, etc.)\n- Temperature > 0 requirement\n- Event log truncation (keep last 200)\n- Runs after every step_one_hour()\n\n---\n\n## 9. DATA LAYER\n\n**tank_data/src/** supplies:\n- source_water_ids(): [soft_acidic, moderate, hard_shrimp, ro_like]\n- substrate_ids(): [inert_sand, inert_gravel, active_planted, coarse_porous]\n- plant_ids(): [fast_stem, root_rosette]\n- shrimp_ids(): [neocaridina_davidi]\n- process_ids(): [default]\n- scenario_ids(): [nano_cycle, medium_planted, warm_room]\n\n**tank_scenarios/** materializes scenario preset into full TankState:\n- Geometry from scenario\n- Water from source water profile\n- Substrate/plant/process from preset IDs\n- Source water catalog pre-populated with all known profiles\n\n---\n\n## 10. SNAPSHOT & UI EXPOSURE\n\n**TankSnapshot** (types/snapshot.rs) exposes per-liter values derived from totals:\n- day, hour\n- water_temp_c\n- water_volume_l\n- tan_mg_l (total ammonia nitrogen)\n- nh3_mg_l (unionized ammonia, calculated)\n- nitrite_mg_l, nitrate_mg_l, phosphate_mg_l\n- do_mg_l (dissolved oxygen)\n- do_sat_mg_l (saturation at current temp)\n- gh_d (General Hardness in degrees)\n- kh_d (Carbonate Hardness)\n- tds_mg_l (Total Dissolved Solids)\n- conductivity_us_cm\n- ph (calculated from alkalinity + DIC)\n- adult_shrimp_count\n- total_plant_biomass_g\n- last_heater_output_w\n- recent_events (last 20)\n\n**TuiApp** (tank_tui/src/) is a placeholder with:\n- Screen enum: Overview, Chemistry, Biology, Actions, Log\n- queue_action, update_snapshot methods\n- No rendering or event loop yet\n\n---\n\n## 11. CRITICAL IMPLEMENTATION DETAILS\n\n### Mass Balance Approach\n- All internal state is mass/amount (mg, meq, g, count)\n- Concentrations derived at display time (snapshot)\n- Water changes work on absolute masses, not concentrations\n- This ensures determinism and correctness\n\n### Determinism\n- ChaCha8Rng with seed tracking (draws count)\n- SimRng serializable for save/load\n- Same seed + actions + version = same state (proven by save_load_resume_determinism test)\n\n### Temperature Physics\n- Uses hourly discrete steps with dT = (Q/C_p) × dt\n- Surface exchange adjustable by geometry (open vs lidded)\n- Heat transfer coefficients (k_surface, k_wall) stored in ProcessParams\n\n### Event Framework Ready\n- 13 EventKind variants defined\n- 11 EventCause codes\n- 3 severity levels\n- Engine accepts events anytime via push_event()\n- Ready for chemistry-based thresholds\n\n---\n\n## 12. WHAT WORKS TODAY\n\n✓ Tank geometry modeling\n✓ Temperature dynamics (heater + ambient)\n✓ DO saturation calculation\n✓ pH and NH3 fraction calculation\n✓ Water change mixing (mass balance)\n✓ Source water profiling\n✓ Player action queueing & validation\n✓ Event framework (data structures + logging)\n✓ Deterministic save/load\n✓ Scenario materialization\n✓ RNG with deterministic continuation\n\n---\n\n## 13. WHAT'S NEEDED FOR MILESTONE 3\n\n1. **Decomposition System** (systems/decomposition.rs)\n   - Particulate → Fine → Dissolved breakdown\n   - Organic N mineralization to ammonia\n   - Use ProcessParams.mineralization_rate_per_day\n\n2. **Nitrification System** (systems/nitrification.rs)\n   - Ammonia oxidizer growth (AOA)\n   - Nitrite oxidizer growth (NOB)\n   - Comammox pathway\n   - TAN → NO2 → NO3 (3 stages)\n   - Temperature/pH/O2 dependencies\n   - Use ProcessParams.nitrification_vmax\n\n3. **Reaeration System** (systems/reaeration.rs)\n   - DO uptake from air\n   - Surface exchange based on reaeration_kla\n   - Aeration hardware boost (if enabled)\n   - Temperature effect on saturation\n\n4. **Event Emission Logic** (engine.rs or systems)\n   - Check for AmmoniaWarning (nh3_mg_l > threshold)\n   - Check for NitriteWarning (nitrite > threshold)\n   - Check for OxygenDip (do_mg_l < do_sat_mg_l × 0.5)\n   - Integrate into step_one_hour()\n\n5. **Chemistry Helper Functions**\n   - Ionization state calculations\n   - Toxicity indices\n   - Stress thresholds\n\n**Estimated files to create**:\n- systems/decomposition.rs\n- systems/nitrification.rs\n- systems/reaeration.rs\n- types/chemistry_helpers.rs (or inline in systems)\n- Additional tests for all 3 systems\n\n---\n\nEND OF REPORT","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01SdK2x77EeKtVykT9EyhLAo","session_id":"6255bc57-f0df-446f-b528-6846cbe58c9c","uuid":"6a206617-3fe8-4f42-9f79-faef11a04d05"}
